    "rating": 5,
    "text": "The added touch of having Heather at our daughter’s wedding was such a neat experience. Heather was so sweet and talented. She even let me and other guests make a few brush strokes on the canvas which was very special. I can’t wait to see the final result of her exceptional work. I am so happy that my daughter chose Heather to be at her special day!",
